# test/api-surface.snapshot.md is generated wholesale from the built declarations. Two branches that
# each regenerate it against their own tree produce edits in different regions of the file, which git
# will text-merge cleanly into a snapshot that matches NEITHER build — a silent wrong answer in the
# one file whose whole job is to be authoritative. `-merge` turns that into an ordinary conflict.
#
# To resolve a conflict here, do not hand-edit: rebuild and regenerate.
#
#     npm run build && npm run api-surface:update
#
# (api-surface:update throws after rewriting the file — that is success, not failure.)
test/api-surface.snapshot.md -merge
